@@ -0,0 +1,37 @@
+= aerospace-position(1)
+include::util/man-attributes.adoc[]
+:manname: aerospace-position
+// tag::purpose[]
+:manpurpose: Set the position of the focused window (floating windows only)
+// end::purpose[]
+
+// =========================================================== Synopsis
+== Synopsis
+[verse]
+// tag::synopsis[]
+aerospace position [-h|--help] [--window-id <window-id>] (center)
+
+// end::synopsis[]
+
+// =========================================================== Description
+== Description
+
+// tag::body[]
+{manpurpose}
+
+Currently only supports centering floating windows. The `center` argument positions the window in the middle of the screen, taking up 75% of the screen dimensions with equal padding on all sides.
+
+If the window is a tiling window, it will first be changed to floating before being positioned.
+
+// =========================================================== Options
+include::./util/conditional-options-header.adoc[]
+
+-h, --help:: Print help
+
+--window-id <window-id>::
+include::./util/window-id-flag-desc.adoc[]
+
+// end::body[]
+
+// =========================================================== Footer
+include::util/man-footer.adoc[]
